---
import PolicyLayout from "../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro";
---
<PolicyLayout title="Refund requests" description="How to contact BlogStack about a charge, cancellation or refund.">
 <p>Contact support with your account email, order ID, charge date and reason for the request. Do not send card numbers, passwords or verification codes.</p>
 <p>Refund requests are reviewed through the payment provider and applicable requirements. Submitting a request does not automatically cancel a subscription; use Payments &amp; cancellation in account settings to prevent renewal.</p>
 <p>Approved full refunds or payment revocations may end the refunded service period. Export your content while access is available. Statutory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
